[00:00.000] 作词 : Courtney Barnett
[00:00.000] 作曲 : Courtney Barnett
[00:00.000]What's inside that cloudy little head, c'mon, won't you stretch it out?
[00:10.302]Afraid they'll really see ya and figure what you're all about
[00:20.000]Everybody knows you're as perfect as the roses in the ground
[00:29.104]You don't see that though, you're so busy on your own little cloud
[00:36.136]
[00:36.569]Sometimes impatient, but mostly patient
[00:45.742]I see you waiting for things to change
[00:54.882]Outside it's raining, precipitating
[01:04.088]I know you're aching for better days
[01:13.595]
[01:14.805]Tried all your tricks, it won't fix anything this time
[01:23.181]Got your eyes on the prize, like a bird looking for sunshine
[01:36.263]
[01:49.528]What's behind that frowning little face?
[01:52.919]Sometimes you wanna throw it all away
[02:00.607]Hope that you don't mind me saying I think that would be a waste
[02:09.287]When you're feeling like a stone, skipping on your own across the waves
[02:18.207]So lonely in the zone, I think you oughta give yourself a break
[02:26.544]
[02:26.846]Sometimes impatient, but mostly patient
[02:36.204]I see you waiting for things to change
[02:45.491]Outside it's raining, precipitating
[02:54.683]I know you're aching for brighter days
